.SS " bool urllib3\&.util\&.ssl_\&._is_bpo_43522_fixed (str implementation_name, \fB_TYPE_VERSION_INFO\fP version_info, \fB_TYPE_VERSION_INFO\fP | None pypy_version_info)\fC [protected]\fP"

.PP
.nf
Return True for CPython 3\&.9\&.3+ or 3\&.10+ and PyPy 7\&.3\&.8+ where
setting SSLContext\&.hostname_checks_common_name to False works\&.

Outside of CPython and PyPy we don't know which implementations work
or not so we conservatively use our hostname matching as we know that works
on all implementations\&.

https://github\&.com/urllib3/urllib3/issues/2192#issuecomment-821832963
https://foss\&.heptapod\&.net/pypy/pypy/-/issues/3539

.fi
